Intelligent Project Scheduling Assistance System
🎓 Overview
A comprehensive AI-powered platform that helps students plan and manage academic projects effectively. The system uses historical patterns, rule-based algorithms, and intelligent recommendations to optimize project schedules, identify skill gaps, and provide personalized learning paths.

✨ Key Features
User Management: Role-based authentication (Student/Faculty)
Skill Assessment: Self-assessment with 1-5 proficiency scale
Skill Gap Analysis: Rule-based comparison engine with priority scoring
Intelligent Scheduling: Timeline optimization based on skill proficiency
Learning Recommendations: Personalized resource suggestions
Progress Tracking: Real-time milestone monitoring with delay alerts
Career Planning: Industry-aligned skill development roadmaps
Faculty Mentoring: Student progress dashboards and feedback system
Cloud Access: MongoDB backend with session management

🛠️ Tech Stack
Backend:           Python 3.8+
Framework:         Flask 2.3.2
Database:          MongoDB (mongodb://localhost:27017/)
ORM:               PyMongo 4.4.1
Security:          Werkzeug (Password Hashing)
Date Handling:     python-dateutil 2.8.2
Session Mgmt:      Flask Sessions
Server:            Flask Development Server (Port 5006)


Frontend:          HTML5, Vanilla JavaScript, CSS3
Styling:           Custom CSS (Responsive Design)
UI Framework:      None (Pure CSS Grid/Flexbox)
Icons:             Unicode Emojis
Forms:             Native HTML Forms


🚀 Quick Start
Prerequisites
Python 3.8+

MongoDB (running on localhost:27017)

1. Clone & Setup
cd intelligent_project_scheduling

2. Install Dependencies
pip install -r requirements.txt

3. Start MongoDB
mongod  # or systemctl start mongod


4. Run Application
python app.py


5. Access System
http://localhost:5006


🔬 Core Algorithms Implemented
1. Skill Gap Analysis Algorithm
Priority = (Gap_Value × Importance) × Severity_Multiplier
Severity: Gap≥3 (1.5x), Gap≥2 (1.2x)

2. Recommendation Engine
Score = Skill_Match(40) + Difficulty(30) + Time(20) + Format(10)
Top 3 resources per gap (Score ≥ 40)

3. Intelligent Scheduling
Duration = Base_Hours × Proficiency_Multiplier + Gap_Buffer
Multiplier: <2(2.0x), <3(1.5x), <4(1.2x), ≥4(1.0x)
Buffer: 2hrs per gap level

4. Delay Detection
Alerts: OVERDUE (>100%), AT_RISK (≥20% deviation), WARNING (≥10%)

5. Learning Path Prioritization
Priority = (Urgency×0.4) + (Career×0.3) + (Ease×0.2) + (Importance×0.1)

